From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 00:29:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/49] winewayland: Prefer direct dmabuf for simple window
 surfaces

Use a direct parent dmabuf path for single opaque full-window producers,
and fall back to SHM or child dmabuf composition when the window needs a
carrier surface.

Keep compositor config state authoritative while processing configure events,
and avoid exposing fallback contents while client surfaces are still providing
the visible frame.
---
 dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c | 490 +++++++++++++++++++------
 dlls/winewayland.drv/waylanddrv.h      |  13 +-
 dlls/winewayland.drv/window.c          | 105 +++++-
 3 files changed, 474 insertions(+), 134 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
index ad39bcfd229..4247fe1629b 100644
--- a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
+++ b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
